  {
   "id": "p01",
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "Rig had known since the wreck that there was a radio in it, and that the radio still worked, and that it had no reach at all down among the trees.",
   "scene": {
    "biome": "wreck",
    "time": "day",
    "weather": "clear",
    "actors": [
     {
      "kind": "robot",
      "pos": "centre",
      "state": "sitting"
     }
    ],
    "props": [
     {
      "kind": "crate",
      "pos": "right",
      "size": "medium"
     }
    ],
    "relations": []
   },
   "audio": "signal-11/p01.mp3",
   "durationSec": 8.54,
   "srcHash": "82d3d2ca6a6e5af24dbb9f9a290b978b0741c33d"
  },
  {
   "id": "p02",
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "He had not touched it for a whole winter. Now, with a machine sweeping the forest in straight lines, he wanted to know who was looking, and why.",
   "scene": {
    "biome": "wreck",
    "time": "day",
    "weather": "clear",
    "actors": [
     {
      "kind": "robot",
      "pos": "left",
      "state": "sitting"
     },
     {
      "kind": "goose",
      "pos": "right",
      "state": "standing"
     }
    ],
    "props": [
     {
      "kind": "crate",
      "pos": "centre",
      "size": "small"
     }
    ],
    "relations": []
   },
   "audio": "signal-11/p02.mp3",
   "durationSec": 9.72,
   "srcHash": "107668cde86abf72310d8451b0a8492d735062e9"
  },
  {
   "id": "p03",
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "So he carried the radio up to the ridge, where the trees ran out and the sky started, and there he began to build a tower.",
   "scene": {
    "biome": "clearing",
    "time": "day",
    "weather": "clear",
    "actors": [
     {
      "kind": "robot",
      "pos": "left",
      "state": "running"
     }
    ],
    "props": [
     {
      "kind": "rock",
      "pos": "right",
      "size": "large"
     }
    ],
    "relations": []
   },
   "audio": "signal-11/p03.mp3",
   "durationSec": 7.68,
   "srcHash": "20005ed46dbc801332f259a7761307169d9d6076"
  },
  {
   "id": "p04",
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "It was made of dead branches and wire and one long piece of pipe, and it took eleven days. Twice it fell over. The third time he tied the bottom to three rocks, and it stood steady.",
   "scene": {
    "biome": "clearing",
    "time": "dusk",
    "weather": "clear",
    "actors": [
     {
      "kind": "robot",
      "pos": "left",
      "state": "standing"
     }
    ],
    "props": [
     {
      "kind": "antenna",
      "pos": "centre",
      "size": "large"
     },
     {
      "kind": "rock",
      "pos": "centre",
      "size": "small"
     }
    ],
    "relations": [
     {
      "subject": "rock",
      "rel": "under",
      "object": "antenna"
     }
    ]
   },
   "audio": "signal-11/p04.mp3",
   "durationSec": 12.77,
   "srcHash": "c1eed9857417fba8b828498884a3b51a988ea817"
  },
  {
   "id": "p05",
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "Rig had to climb it to fix the wire at the top, which is not a thing you should do with one working arm. He did it slowly. The goose watched from below and made a noise the whole time.",
   "scene": {
    "biome": "clearing",
    "time": "dusk",
    "weather": "clear",
    "actors": [
     {
      "kind": "robot",
      "pos": "centre",
      "state": "standing"
     },
     {
      "kind": "goose",
      "pos": "left",
      "state": "standing"
     }
    ],
    "props": [
     {
      "kind": "antenna",
      "pos": "centre",
      "size": "large"
     }
    ],
    "relations": [
     {
      "subject": "robot",
      "rel": "on top of",
      "object": "antenna"
     }
    ]
   },
   "audio": "signal-11/p05.mp3",
   "durationSec": 11.78,
   "srcHash": "87ee0512021cdb1ab747c5c3608f2d44d6300dee"
  },
  {
   "id": "p06",
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "Then he switched the radio on. For a long moment there was nothing at all. And then, very faint and very far away, a signal came back — the same three notes, over and over, waiting for an answer.",
   "scene": {
    "biome": "clearing",
    "time": "night",
    "weather": "clear",
